# Title: Supreme Court Judicial Power
# Summary: A data-backed benchmark derived from the Supreme Court judicial-power fit, with one issue atom feeding a single nine-justice undirected interaction component sourced either from the executed HITON artifacts or a paper-aligned XMRF re-estimation.
# Benchmark Family: supreme_court_judicial_power
# issue_judicial_power: The Supreme Court case falls in the judicial power issue area.
# lib_breyer: Justice Stephen Breyer casts a liberal vote.
# lib_ginsburg: Justice Ruth Bader Ginsburg casts a liberal vote.
# lib_kennedy: Justice Anthony Kennedy casts a liberal vote.
# lib_oconnor: Justice Sandra Day O'Connor casts a liberal vote.
# lib_rehnquist: Chief Justice William Rehnquist casts a liberal vote.
# lib_scalia: Justice Antonin Scalia casts a liberal vote.
# lib_souter: Justice David Souter casts a liberal vote.
# lib_stevens: Justice John Paul Stevens casts a liberal vote.
# lib_thomas: Justice Clarence Thomas casts a liberal vote.

